%description:

LogNormalShadowing with a correlation distance on a medium whose analog model
is DimensionalMediumAnalogModel: an error at initialization. That model
computes the path loss per frequency from the distance alone, so the
shadowing value could not be kept per link, and the correlation distance
would silently have no effect.

%file: test.ned

import inet.physicallayer.wireless.common.medium.DimensionalRadioMedium;

network Test
{
    submodules:
        radioMedium: DimensionalRadioMedium;
}

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
network = Test
ned-path = .;../../../../src
cmdenv-express-mode = false

*.radioMedium.backgroundNoise.powerSpectralDensity = -120dBmWpMHz
*.radioMedium.pathLoss.typename = "LogNormalShadowing"
*.radioMedium.pathLoss.correlationDistance = 10m

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%# remove colorizing
%subst: /\x1B\[[0-9;]*m//
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "<!>" test.* > test_err.out || true
%contains: test_err.out
correlationDistance cannot be used with DimensionalMediumAnalogModel
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
